sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Agent
    participant Client as OAuth Client
    participant AuthServer as Auth Server
    participant ResourceServer as Resource Server

    autonumber
    
    User->>+Client: Click login
    Client->>+AuthServer: Redirect to login
    AuthServer->>User: Show login form
    User->>AuthServer: Enter credentials
    AuthServer->>-Client: Redirect with auth code
    Client->>Client: Store auth code
    Client->>-User: Logged in
    
    Note over User,AuthServer: User is authenticated
    
    User->>Client: Request resource
    activate Client
    Client->>+AuthServer: POST /token (with code)
    AuthServer-->>-Client: Access token
    Client->>+ResourceServer: GET /profile (with token)
    ResourceServer-->>-Client: User profile
    Client-->>User: Display profile
    deactivate Client
    
    par User actions
        User->>Client: View history
    and System check
        Client->>ResourceServer: GET /history
        ResourceServer-->>Client: History data
    end
    
    Client-->>User: History displayed
